ugh detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <h1>Member profile</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Public profile for a community member. Follow to see their posts and project updates in your feed.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"row between\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap; gap:1rem;\">\n      <div class=\"row gap-lg\" style=\"align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n        <div class=\"avatar profile-avatar\">AO</div>\n        <div class=\"stack\" style=\"gap:.25rem;\">\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0;\">Amara Osei</h2>\n            <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Pro member</span>\n            <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Verified</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"muted\">Staff Product Designer · Payments &amp; Identity</div>\n          <div class=\"small muted\">Lagos, Nigeria · Joined March 2021 · Active today</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\" id=\"actions\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" type=\"button\">Message</button>\n        <button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" id=\"followBtn\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Follow</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p style=\"margin:0;\">Designs the boring parts of money on purpose — ledgers, limits and payout flows that never surprise anyone. Currently rebuilding merchant onboarding at Kite Payments; previously design systems at Northwind Bank. Writes about accessibility and financial UX.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Design systems</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Fintech UX</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Accessibility</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Figma</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Research</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"followHint\" style=\"margin:0;\">You'll see Amara's posts and project updates in your feed.</p>\n\n    <hr>\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n      <div class=\"stat-tile stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"stat-label\">Followers</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"followerCount\">12,438</div>\n        <div class=\"small up\">▲ +312 this month</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat-tile stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"stat-label\">Following</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-value\">318</div>\n        <div class=\"small muted\">Across 9 communities</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat-tile stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"stat-label\">Projects shipped</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-value\">47</div>\n        <div class=\"small muted\">12 in the last quarter</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"row between\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Profile completeness</span>\n        <span class=\"small muted\">92%</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"progress\"><div style=\"width:92%\"></div></div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:0;\">Two portfolio case studies still need a write-up before the profile is fully indexed in search.</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n    <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3 class=\"card-title\" style=\"margin:0;\">Details</h3>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\" style=\"margin:0;\">Public information shared by this member.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <table>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"muted\">Works at</td>\n            <td>Kite Payments</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"muted\">Role level</td>\n            <td>Staff · 9 yrs experience</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"muted\">Website</td>\n            <td>amaraosei.design</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"muted\">Timezone</td>\n            <td>WAT (UTC+1)</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"muted\">Languages</td>\n            <td>English, Twi, Yoruba</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"muted\">Response time</td>\n            <td>Usually within 4 hours</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3 class=\"card-title\" style=\"margin:0;\">Mutual connections</h3>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\" style=\"margin:0;\">4 people you both follow.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"row between\">\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\">RN</div>\n            <div class=\"stack\" style=\"gap:0;\">\n              <span>Ravi Nandakumar</span>\n              <span class=\"small muted\">Engineering Manager · Kite Payments</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Mutual</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"row between\">\n          <div clas